## Executive Summary

This repository hosts the comprehensive equity research coverage, three-statement financial model, econometric elasticity analysis, and integrated ESG valuation scenario for **Arabian Cement Company (ARCC.CA)**. The research was developed as part of the **CFA Institute Research Challenge**.

We initiate coverage on Arabian Cement Company with a **BUY** recommendation and a 12-month blended target price of **EGP 124.00 per share**, offering a **+69% upside** against the current market price of **EGP 73.45** (as of September 26, 2026).

The investment thesis centers on ARCC's transformation following Egypt's 2025 cement supply inflection[cite: 2, 3]. Driven by an integrated Suez maritime footprint, aggressive alternative fuel substitution, disciplined fixed-cost dilution, and export flexibility, ARCC has evolved beyond cyclical commodity dependence into an agile, cash-generative industrial platform.

